<title>USA: Sled Dogs seeking strategic partner.</title>
<headline>Sled Dogs seeking strategic partner.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sled Dogs Co said Thursday it retained an investment banker to help it form a strategic partnership so it could continue the development of snow skating products.</p>
<p>It said it was seeking a strategic partner that would provide access to resources. No further details were available.</p>
<p>The company manufactures and sells Sled Dogs snow skates and related accessories.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
